Standards-Version: 4.5.1
Homepage: https://github.com/ajmccaus/touch-timeout
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/ajmccaus/touch-timeout.git

Package: touch-timeout
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Touchscreen backlight dimming and timeout daemon
 touch-timeout dims the display backlight after a period without touch
 input and switches it off after a longer one; a touch, or SIGUSR1,
 restores full brightness (-b). Backlight and touchscreen are
 auto-detected. The service only starts when /sys/class/backlight has
 an entry.
